  "¿Qué anuncia la recepcionista de manera honorífica?": "What does the receptionist announce using honorific language?",
  "대표님 = presidente · 일정표 = horario · 드리다 = dar humildemente.": "대표님 = president · 일정표 = schedule · 드리다 = give respectfully.",
  "께 marca al receptor honrado y 드리다 es el humilde de 주다: la acción va de «yo» al presidente.": "께 marks the honored receiver and 드리다 is the humble of 주다: the action goes from \"me\" to the president.",
