  "어릴 때 = cuando era pequeño · 읽다 = leer · 보관되다 = conservarse.": "어릴 때 = as a child · 읽다 = read · 보관되다 = be preserved.",
  "읽던 책 (G099) señala el libro asociado a la lectura habitual o interrumpida del pasado, no uno futuro ni necesariamente terminado.": "읽던 책 (G099) points out the book associated with the usual or interrupted reading of the past, not a future or necessarily finished one.",
  "Un libro que el príncipe terminó de escribir de niño.": "A book the prince finished writing as a child.",
