  "¿Qué clase de libro guarda el pasillo?": "What kind of book is kept in the corridor?",
  "물이 새다 = filtrarse agua · 막히다 = quedar bloqueado.": "물이 새다 = leak water · 막히다 = be blocked / clogged.",
  "물이 새던 복도 (G099) describe una característica repetida del pasillo en el pasado; 지금… 막혀 있어요 contrasta con su estado actual.": "물이 새던 복도 (G099) describes a repeated feature of the corridor in the past; 지금… 막혀 있어요 contrasts with its current state.",
  "El pasillo se inundó una única vez esta noche.": "The hallway was flooded once tonight.",
