  "El muro provoca que empiece a llover.": "The wall causes it to start raining.",
  "Por ese pasillo solía entrar agua cuando llovía; ahora está tapiado.": "Water used to come through that corridor when it rained; it is now blocked.",
  "¿Qué revela la mancha de humedad del cuarto retrato?": "What does the moisture stain on the fourth portrait reveal?",
  "들고 가다 = llevar consigo · 발견되다 = ser hallado.": "들고 가다 = carry along · 발견되다 = be found.",
  "들고 가던 (G099) enfoca una acción en curso e interrumpida: la llevaba, pero el trayecto no se completó.": "들고 가던 (G099) focuses an ongoing action and is interrupted: it was carried, but the journey was not completed.",
  "해원 fabricó una linterna roja después de bajar la escalera.": "해원 made a red lantern after going down the staircase.",
