  "La tinta sigue húmeda. ¿Qué interpretación expresa la frase?": "The ink is still wet. What interpretation does the phrase express?",
  "가장자리 = borde · 새로 = recientemente · 가운데 = centro.": "가장자리 = edge · 새로 = recently · 가운데 = center.",
  "잘린 듯하지만 combina la inferencia pasada 잘린 듯하다 (G238) con contraste; solo afecta al borde.": "잘린 듯하지만 combines past inference 잘린 듯하다 (G238) with contrast; it only affects the edge.",
  "El borde parece recién cortado, pero la señal central es antigua.": "The edge looks freshly cut, but the central signal is old.",
  "Todo el mapa parece recién fabricado.": "The whole map looks freshly made.",
  "El centro fue cortado y el borde quedó intacto.": "The center was cut and the edge was intact.",
  "El mapa antiguo debe ser destruido.": "The old map must be destroyed.",
  "¿Qué distingue la conservadora en el mapa?": "What does the heritage conservator make out on the map?",
  "필체 = caligrafía · 여러 시대 = varias épocas · 반복되다 = repetirse.": "필체 = handwriting · 여러 시대 = several eras · 반복되다 = recur.",
  "반복되는 듯해요 (G238) usa -는 듯하다 para una apariencia vigente observada al comparar los libros.": "반복되는 듯해요 (G238) uses -는 듯하다 for a current appearance observed when comparing books.",
  "Una sola cuenta se repite cada día.": "A single account is repeated every day.",
