  "밤새 = durante toda la noche · 조사하다 = investigar.": "밤새 = all night · 조사하다 = investigate.",
  "조사하다 → 조사한 끝에 (G227). -(으)ㄴ 끝에 empaqueta el esfuerzo previo y presenta su resultado.": "조사하다 → 조사한 끝에 (G227). -(으)ㄴ 끝에 packs the previous effort and presents its result.",
  "Tras investigar toda la noche el libro antiguo, comprobamos la fecha borrada.": "After researching the old book all night, we checked the date deleted.",
  "복원하다 = restaurar · 알아내다 = averiguar.": "복원하다 = restore · 알아내다 = find out.",
  "복원한 끝에 (G227) conecta muchas tentativas de restauración con el hallazgo final.": "복원한 끝에 (G227) connects many restoration attempts to the final finding.",
  "Después de restaurar varias veces el disco astronómico roto, averiguamos dónde estaba la puerta norte.": "After restoring the broken astronomical disk several times, we found out where the north gate was.",
  "비교하다 = comparar · 순찰로 = ruta de patrulla.": "비교하다 = compare · 순찰로 = patrol route.",
  "비교하다 → 비교한 끝에 (G227). No significa simplemente «después»; recalca deliberación y esfuerzo.": "비교하다 → 비교한 끝에 (G227). It does not simply mean \"after\", emphasizes deliberation and effort.",
  "Tras comparar uno a uno cinco mapas, escogimos la verdadera ruta de patrulla.": "After comparing one to one five maps, we chose the real patrol route.",
  "기다리다 = esperar · 구름이 걷히다 = despejarse las nubes.": "기다리다 = wait · 구름이 걷히다 = the clouds clear.",
  "기다리다 → 기다린 끝에 (G227): el resultado llega únicamente tras una espera considerable.": "기다리다 → 기다린 끝에 (G227): the result comes only after a considerable wait.",
  "Después de esperar mucho a que se despejaran las nubes, identificamos la puerta iluminada por la luna.": "After waiting a long time for the clouds to clear, we identified the moonlit door.",
  "거짓 = falso · 남쪽 = sur. La primera cláusula es la excepción.": "거짓 = false · 남쪽 = south. The first clause is the exception.",
  "A-(으)면 몰라도, B (G189) = «a no ser que A, B». Presenta la única condición que podría invalidar B.": "A-(으)면 몰라도, B (G189) = “unless A, B”. It presents the only condition that could invalidate B.",
  "Solo si el registro de patrulla de 해원 fuera falso.": "Only if the 해원 patrol record was fake.",
