  "¿Bajo qué única condición podría abrirse al sur?": "Under what condition could it be opened to the south?",
  "모두 끄다 = apagarlas todas · 돌아가다 = volver.": "모두 끄다 = turn them all off · 돌아가다 = go back.",
  "끄면 몰라도 (G189) marca la excepción: salvo que se apaguen todas, el retorno no ocurre.": "끄면 몰라도 (G189) marks the exception: unless all are turned off, the return does not occur.",
